      <section>

      <h1 id="research-publications">Research Publications</h1>

<!-- _pages/publications.md -->
<div class="publications">
Below is the full list of my publications with pointers to the papers and related material (full version, implementations, etc).

<p>
I have so far co-authored 79 publications in <a href="#confpapers">conference proceedings</a>, and  19 papers in <a href="#journalpapers">journals</a>.
As it is customary in the cryptography community, the order of authors in most of my papers is alphabetical and not by contribution, and we publish mostly in conferences.
</p>

<h2 id="confpapers">Papers in conference proceedings</h2>
